                                                           'Email: $referral_partner_notice_email',
                                                           'With a copy to counsel: '
                                                           '$referral_partner_notice_counsel_copy',
                                                           '23.4\u2003Entire Agreement.\u2003This '
                                                           'Agreement, together with its Schedules '
                                                           'and Exhibits, constitutes the entire '
                                                           'agreement between the Parties with '
                                                           'respect to its subject matter and '
