                                                           'waiver on one occasion is not a waiver '
                                                           'as to any other occasion.',
                                                           '23.6\u2003Counterparts and Electronic '
                                                           'Signature.\u2003This Agreement may be '
                                                           'executed in counterparts, each of '
                                                           'which is an original and all of which '
                                                           'together constitute one instrument. '
                                                           'Signatures delivered by facsimile, '
                                                           'portable document format, or '
